<article class="env-lemma" id="9E1E02">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/9E1E02">Lemma <span data-tag="9E1E02">7.3.2.2</span>.</a> Let $\calX $ be an $\infty $-topos and let $f: \emptyset \rightarrow X$ be a morphism in $\calX $, where $\emptyset $ is an initial object. Then $f$ is a monomorphism. </p>
</article>
<article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Apply Lemma <a href="/tag/D1C141" data-tag="D1C141">7.3.2.1</a> to the $\infty $-topos $\calX _{/X}$. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>